+\begin{example}[a zero of arbitrary multiplicity]\label{v4-arith:db:ex:multiple}
+Let $A(z)=z^m$ for an integer $m\ge1$. Then
+\[
+ E=A+iA'=z^{m-1}(z+im),\qquad
+ \Theta(z)=\frac{z-im}{z+im},\qquad
